      "url": "https://greenroad.com/webinars/",
      "description": "Fleet Safety & Telematics Webinar | GreenRoad Products AskMila™️ – AI assistant GreenRoad Digital Edge™ Software Solution GreenRoad Drive™ App GreenRoad Edge™ Hardware Solution GreenRoad Central™ Safety platform Videosense™ Pro Video Telematics Industries Passenger Transport Oil & Gas, Mining Utilities Delivery Food & Beverages Construction Services About Us Company Overview Investors Offices Partners Careers Resources Blogs Articles Customer Stories Brochures and Ebooks Webinars Events Contact Us Products AskMila™️ – AI assistant GreenRoad Digital Edge™ Software Solution GreenRoad Drive™ App GreenRoad Edge™ Hardware Solution GreenRoad Central™ Safety platform Videosense™ Pro Video Telematics Industries Passenger Transport Oil & Gas, Mining Utilities Delivery Food & Beverages Construction Services About Us Company Overview Investors Offices Partners Careers Resources Blogs Articles Customer Stories Brochures and Ebooks Webinars Events Contact Us Real Stories. Real Impact. Real Innovation. Driving the Future: Transformative Insights in Fleet Safety Watch the Full Webinar Series Now Watch how industry leaders like Iron Mountain and RATP Dev are changing the game with GreenRoad’s proactive approach to fleet safety — cutting accidents, improving performance, and reshaping driver behavior at scale. You’ll also meet AskMila™ , our AI tool built specifically for fleet safety teams. Mila doesn’t follow scripts. She listens like an analyst, spots what others miss, and delivers fresh insights. This isn’t just about automation. It’s about seeing differently, acting faster, and keeping your fleet safer than ever. Watch the Full Webinar Series Now Webinars What if your fleet could predict risk before an incident? AskMila™ In this webinar, we will discuss how AI Safety Agent AskMila helps fleets identify risk earlier, improve driver behavior, reduce fuel consumption, and prevent incidents before they happen. View AI-powered Fleet Management Smarter fleets, safer operations: Real-time, AI-driven insights and coaching that reduce incidents, cut fuel and emissions, and boost performance across vehicle types. View AskMila™ Let Your Data Do the Heavy Lifting Our AI analyst doesn’t follow scripts. She thinks like your best safety expert, spotting patterns others miss and delivering insights that drive real change. View From Road risk to Road Heroes How do you use data effectively to understand what your drivers are doing? Learn about best practices and actionable insights in our discussion with Rory Morgan from Iron Mountain. View Building an Effective Driver Safety Program Operating nearly 1,200 buses in one of Europe’s most complex urban environments, RATP Dev Transit London understands the importance of modern safety systems. COO Nigel Wood shares the company’s systematic approach to enhancing fleet safety. View Watch the Webinar Related Content Case Study Achieving Customer, Economic and Environmental Benefits Case Study Back to School: What Changes for Bus and Coach Operators Case Study Driving the Future: The GreenRoad Guide to Electric Vehicle Fleet Safety | New eBook Home Industries News Resources Download Brochures Home Industries News Resources Download Brochures Company Overview Investors Partners Careers Company Overview Investors Partners Careers Customer Stories FAQs Support Login Sign Up for Our Newsletter Customer Stories FAQs Support Login Sign Up for Our Newsletter Go Back to the Top Meet Our Experts Facebook-f Linkedin Twitter Youtube 2026 GreenRoad Technologies, Inc. All Rights Reserved Privacy Terms of Use GDPR Cookies ISO 27001 Privacy Terms of Use GDPR Cookies ISO 27001",
