      "url": "https://greenroad.com/career/regional-sales-director-northern-europe/",
      "description": "We're Hiring! - Regional Sales Director – Northern Europe | GreenRoad Products AskMila™️ – AI assistant GreenRoad Digital Edge™ Software Solution GreenRoad Drive™ App GreenRoad Edge™ Hardware Solution GreenRoad Central™ Safety platform Videosense™ Pro Video Telematics Industries Passenger Transport Oil & Gas, Mining Utilities Delivery Food & Beverages Construction Services About Us Company Overview Investors Offices Partners Careers Resources Blogs Articles Customer Stories Brochures and Ebooks Webinars Events Contact Us Products AskMila™️ – AI assistant GreenRoad Digital Edge™ Software Solution GreenRoad Drive™ App GreenRoad Edge™ Hardware Solution GreenRoad Central™ Safety platform Videosense™ Pro Video Telematics Industries Passenger Transport Oil & Gas, Mining Utilities Delivery Food & Beverages Construction Services About Us Company Overview Investors Offices Partners Careers Resources Blogs Articles Customer Stories Brochures and Ebooks Webinars Events Contact Us Regional Sales Director – Northern Europe Individual Contributor • Direct& Channel Sales • Reports to the CRO, GreenRoad Company Overview GreenRoad is revolutionizing fleet safety and driver performance, offering cutting-edge AI and the industry’s most comprehensive driving data. Our advanced safety telematics platform provides real-time driver coaching, predictive risk assessments, and in-depth fleet analytics, enabling businesses to significantly reduce accidents, fuel costs, and emissions. With seamless integration and rapid deployment, GreenRoad empowers fleets of all sizes to effect improved and continuous driver behavior, enhance operational efficiency, and achieve sustainability goals. Trusted by hundreds of companies in 70 countries since 2004, GreenRoad helps companies build a safer, greener, and more profitable fleet. Who Are We Looking For? We are growing and seeking an ambitious and accomplished sales professional to lead our next phase of growth across Northern Europe. As we expand, this region may evolve in line with the company’s strategic objectives. The ideal candidate is equally comfortable selling direct — personally prospecting, negotiating, and closing enterprise deals with end customers — and driving indirect growth through resellers, distributors, and strategic channel partners. This is a hands-on role for a hunter who isn’t afraid to roll up their sleeves and go get the deal, while also building and scaling a partner ecosystem that multiplies reach. If you have a proven track record of success in the technology sector across both direct and channel motions, and a passion for driving results, join us in building a safer, smarter future for fleets worldwide. Working at GreenRoad We value initiative, no matter where it comes from. We promote a “can-do” mindset, voice, and approach to make us stronger as a company. We know that it is through team-wide collaboration across geographies that we can make the most positive impact as a company. Your Role as Regional Sales Director Northern Europe Your role’s main objective is to lead and accelerate the growth of GreenRoad’s sales across the Northern European region through both direct and indirect channels . As a sales hunter, you will generate new business directly with enterprise customers while simultaneously recruiting, enabling, and managing reseller and distributor partners to extend GreenRoad’s market coverage. The role requires a well-rounded, hands-on, proactive approach to business as an individual contributor. To ensure success of the region, you will be supported by GreenRoad’s global, multi-disciplinary teams. You should engage, communicate, and align the various company stakeholders — including sales development, marketing, product, and logistics operations — to effectively manage both the direct sales process and the partner-led sales cycle. The Regional Sales Director Northern Europe will report to the Chief Revenue Officer. Key Role Responsibilities Direct sales Lead the company’s new business direct-sales effort in the Northern European region, personally owning the full cycle from prospecting to close. Prospect, qualify, and close new enterprise business deals with end customers. Develop target leads and strategize approaches for creating a direct sales opportunity pipeline. Articulate GreenRoad’s value proposition, run product demos, and execute product trials. Build and maintain senior-level relationships with key prospective enterprise customers. Land Net New logo customers in the Northern European territory. Indirect / channel sales Recruit, onboard, enable, and manage resellers, distributors, and strategic channel partners across NorthernEurope to drive indirect revenue. Build and maintain senior-level relationships with reseller and channel partners, and act as their primary point of contact for deal support, pricing, and escalations. Develop joint sales and sales supporting plans with the indirect channel, set and track partner targets, and manage the partner-sourced pipeline and forecast. Enable partners to independently articulate GreenRoad’s value proposition, run demos, and progress opportunities. Cross-cutting Establish the proper segmented go-to-market approach for the Northern European region — across both direct and indirect motions — for Commercial Fleets and Bus & Coach prospects. Liaise with sales development and marketing teams to define and execute outbound lead generation and new lead funnel development for both direct and partner channels. Provide accurate forecasting across direct and partner-sourced sales pipelines. Understand the competitive landscape and market trends. Requirements GreenRoad is looking for a seasoned yet highly entrepreneurial, customer-focused sales professional with a successful track record of building up regions and exceeding targets through both direct selling and channel development — attaining organizational impact by penetrating new regions and shaping the company’s business reality by clos",
