t-sales effort in the APAC region, personally owning the full cycle from prospecting to close. Prospect, qualify, and close new enterprise business deals with end customers. Develop target leads and strategize approaches for creating a direct sales opportunity pipeline. Articulate GreenRoad’s value proposition, run product demos, and execute product trials. Build and maintain senior-level relationships with key prospective enterprise customers. Land Net New logo customers in the APAC territory. Indirect / channel sales Recruit, onboard, enable, and manage resellers, distributors, and strategic channel partners across NorthernEurope to drive indirect revenue. Build and maintain senior-level relationships with reseller and channel partners, and act as their primary point of contact for deal support, pricing, and escalations. Develop joint sales and sales supporting plans with the indirect channel, set and track partner targets, and manage the partner-sourced pipeline and forecast. Enable partners to independently articulate GreenRoad’s value proposition, run demos, and progress opportunities. Cross-cutting Establish the proper segmented go-to-market approach for the APACregion — across both direct and indirect motions — for Commercial Fleets and Bus & Coach prospects. Liaise with sales development and marketing teams to define and execute outbound lead generation and new lead funnel development for both direct and partner channels. Provide accurate forecasting across direct and partner-sourced sales pipelines. Understand the competitive landscape and market trends. Requirements GreenRoad is looking for a seasoned yet highly entrepreneurial, customer-focused sales professional with a successful track record of building up regions and exceeding targets through both direct selling and channel development — attaining organizational impact by penetrating new regions and shaping the company’s business reality by closing new enterprise deals directly and through partners. Id