r coaching system that reduces risk by guiding drivers in real time and giving managers clear visibility into safety performance. See how it works How GreenRoad Improves Driver Safety Safety improves when drivers get clear feedback during trips – and managers know where to focus coaching. Detect risk as it happens In-vehicle and in-app signals identify risky driving in real time. Coach drivers immediately Drivers self-correct with live feedback during every trip. Act on clear insight Managers focus coaching and planning where risk is highest. Safety For Every Type of Fleet Bus & Coach Commercial Fleets Bus & Coach When passengers are your responsibility, safety has to be consistent, fair, and measurable. GreenRoad helps bus and coach operators reduce preventable incidents by coaching drivers in real time and giving managers clear visibility into risk across routes, depots, and teams. Improved driving behaviour also supports smoother journeys, lower fuel use, and reduced wear – without compromising safety priorities. Real-Time Coaching Driver Focused Safety Management Deep & Accurate Data Easy to Engage. Fast to Deploy. API Integration Talk to a safety expert Real-Time Coaching Safer Driving, Trip by Trip Drivers receive clear feedback during trips, helping them self-correct risky behaviour as it occurs. For managers, real-time coaching supports consistent driving standards across teams – reducing incidents without relying on retrospective intervention. Driver Focused Supporting professional drivers GreenRoad supports professional drivers with clear, fair feedback focused on improvement – not punishment. Consistent coaching and transparent scoring build trust and reinforce safer driving habits over time. Safety Management Consistent, evidence-based safety management GreenRoad gives safety managers clear visibility into driving behaviour across routes, depots, and teams. Consistent, behaviour-based insight supports fair driver scoring, targeted coaching, and early ide